{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53970","headline":"偈 四 · 景岑","name":"偈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摩诃般若照，解脱甚深香（《景德传灯录》作「深」，《五灯会元》作「法」）。\n法身寂灭体，三一理圆常。\n欲识功齐处，此名常寂光。\n（《祖堂集》卷十七、《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}